#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gold Digger"
msgstr "Cercatore d’oro"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be prepared to dig for buried treasure."
msgstr "Preparati a scavare in cerca di un tesoro sepolto."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "From Mission Control"
msgstr "Dal centro di controllo missione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The third <a object|key>key</a> (C) is buried in a mushroom-infested area. A"
" <a object|botss>sniffer</a> should be able to locate it and a <a "
"object|derrick>derrick</a> should be able to extract it."
msgstr ""
"La terza <a object|key>chiave</a> (C) è sepolta in una zona infestata dai "
"funghi. Un <a object|botss>robot rilevatore</a> dovrebbe riuscire a "
"individuarla e una <a object|derrick>torre di estrazione</a> a recuperarla."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When your mission is completed and before taking off, bring both <a "
"object|botshld>shielder</a> and <a object|botsub>subber</a> aboard your "
"spaceship."
msgstr ""
"Dopo aver completato la missione e prima di decollare, porta a bordo "
"dell’astronave il <a object|botshld>robot scudo</a> e il <a "
"object|botsub>robot sommergibile</a>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<format key><key help/></format> allows you to review these instructions at "
"all times on your personal SatCom <button 63/>."
msgstr ""
"<format key><key help/></format> ti permette di rileggere queste istruzioni "
"in qualsiasi momento sul tuo SatCom personale <button 63/>."

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8 ../help/soluce.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "<a command>Controls</a> and <a cbot>CBOT Language</a>"
msgstr "<a command>Comandi</a> e <a cbot>linguaggio CBOT</a>"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/report.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite Report"
msgstr "Rapporto satellitare"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Currently in a geo-stationary orbit of Terranova."
msgstr "Attualmente in orbita geostazionaria attorno a Terranova."

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SURFACE<c/>"
msgstr "-> SUPERFICIE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Temperature:      26.1C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosphere:       oxygen\n"
"\\tab;Wind:             0.4 mps\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     some\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      some"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Temperatura:      26.1C\n"
"\\tab;Atmosfera:       ossigeno\n"
"\\tab;Vento:             0.4 mps\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     presente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      presente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> SUBSOIL<c/>"
msgstr "-> SOTTOSUOLO<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Energy source:    none\n"
"\\tab;Titanium ore:     none\n"
"\\tab;Uranium ore:      none"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Fonte di energia:    assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di titanio:     assente\n"
"\\tab;Minerale di uranio:      assente"

#. type: Source code
#: ../help/report.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "-> ADDITIONAL INFORMATION<c/>"
msgstr "-> INFORMAZIONI AGGIUNTIVE<c/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/report.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\tab;Detected:         giant ants\n"
"\\tab;  - Danger:       immediate\n"
"\\tab;Detected:         giant wasps\n"
"\\tab;  - Danger:       immediate"
msgstr ""
"\\tab;Rilevato:         formiche giganti\n"
"\\tab;  - Pericolo:       immediato\n"
"\\tab;Rilevato:         vespe giganti\n"
"\\tab;  - Pericolo:       immediato"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Walkthrough"
msgstr "Soluzione"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/soluce.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Unfortunately no walkthrough has been provided for this mission.\n"
"You are on your own..."
msgstr ""
"Purtroppo per questa missione non è disponibile una soluzione.\n"
"Dovrai cavartela da solo..."

